+# Notification audio asset
+
+`waiting.s16le` is a generated spoken “Waiting.” cue: signed 16-bit little-endian PCM, mono, 16 kHz, 17,234 samples (about 1.077 seconds). It is embedded in application flash and streamed in 20 ms blocks; it is not copied into a full-size RAM buffer. The mastered level is deliberately restrained for the small speaker: peak −6.44 dBFS, RMS −23.52 dBFS.
+
+- SHA-256: `7b5cc8f462532cfd5df6f68af85513f5c6461ccf06d858c05560b2af03c61775`
+- Generation: ElevenLabs `eleven_v4`, generation `dXA2OMAxGrmCQHWmVS2q`
+- Direction: deep baritone, dry heroic deadpan, restrained
+
+The asset was supplied for this repository from an authorized generation session. No runtime speech service, API key, or additional dependency is used. Confirm the provider/account usage terms before redistributing it outside this firmware.
